  "shortLabel": "Practice Management",
  "icon": "CalendarClock",
  "description": "Optimise the administrative and operational workflows of healthcare practices — GP surgeries, specialist clinics, dental practices, physiotherapy centres. Covers scheduling, referral pathways, patient communications, QOF/recall systems, staff rotas, and template creation. Reduces admin burden so clinical teams can focus on care.",
